Unmodified H2 Database Engine 2.3.232 is bundled for embedded management storage.
Upstream project: https://h2database.com
Source: https://github.com/h2database/h2database
License information: https://www.h2database.com/html/license.html
The bundled release POM lists MPL 2.0 and EPL 1.0; see h2-2.3.232-pom.xml.
The SHA-256 of the bundled JAR is recorded in deployment-ops/docs/dependencies.json.
